  "What is the special month-long set of extra night prayers performed during Ramadan called?": { t: "Comment appelle-t-on les prières nocturnes supplémentaires accomplies tout au long du ramadan ?", o: { "Tarawih": "Les tarawih", "Suhoor": "Le suhur", "Jumu'ah": "La prière du vendredi", "Witr": "Le witr" } },
