  "What is the name for the night journey in which Muhammad is said to have travelled from Mecca to Jerusalem in a single night?": { t: "Comment appelle-t-on le voyage nocturne au cours duquel Mahomet aurait voyagé de La Mecque à Jérusalem en une seule nuit ?", o: { "The Isra": "L'Isra", "The Hijra": "L'hégire", "The Mi'raj": "Le Mi'raj", "The Fath": "Le Fath" } },
